      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-021-fluent-design-system.md</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="SendEmailPage wrapper usage" location="reference §5.1.1 / §7.6">
        `&lt;SendEmailPage mode={modeFromUrl} communicationId={id} authenticatedFetch={...} bffBaseUrl={cfg.bffBaseUrl} associations={fromUrl} onSent={openForm} onClose={close} />`.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Form Component Control swap + fallback" location="reference §7.4 (Surface 2)">
        Register the Code Page as the FCC-hosted main form; keep the standard form as a hidden admin fallback for reversibility.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read task 020's `&lt;EmailComposer />` engine + `SendEmailPage.tsx` wrapper to confirm the exact prop contract (`mode`, `communicationId`, `authenticatedFetch`, `bffBaseUrl`, `associations`, `onSent`, `onClose`).</step>
    <step order="2">Read reference §5.4 (props), §5.10 (page-mount visual variant), §7.5 (mode→action table), §7.6 (bootstrap render).</step>
    <step order="3">In `CommunicationPage/src/index.tsx`, replace task 040's interactive-email seam with `&lt;SendEmailPage />`, wiring `mode` + `communicationId` + pre-fill + `associatedTo`→`associations` from the parsed URL, `authenticatedFetch` + `bffBaseUrl` from the bootstrap, `onSent`→`Xrm.Navigation.openForm`, `onClose`→close.</step>
    <step order="4">Confirm all five modes resolve: compose (blank), view (read record), reply (`Re:` + prefill to/inReplyTo), forward (`Fwd:`), draft (editable draft). The non-email `sprk_communicationtype` branches remain read-only (task 040) — do NOT mount the composer for them.</step>
    <step order="5">Author the Form Component Control registration: create/point a `sprk_communication` main form to a Form Component Control hosting the Code Page web resource; keep the existing standard form as a hidden/admin fallback (do NOT delete). Document the exact form GUIDs / names touched in task notes for reversibility.</step>
    <step order="6">Run `npm run build:prod` — confirm single self-contained artifact; fix any bundling regression.</step>
    <step order="7">Manual dev smoke (documented, not deployed here — deploy is task 043): confirm the wrapper renders for each mode against seeded records; note any gaps for 043 UI tests.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: invoke `code-review` on the diff; invoke `adr-check` against `spec.md` (ADR-026/028/012/021). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: mark 041 ✅; confirm 043 unblocked (needs 040+041+042). Update `current-task.md` (record the FCC form GUIDs + fallback-retention decision; advance to next task).</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="read">Inspect SendEmailPage wrapper + reference §5/§7</tool>
    <tool name="edit">Mount composer into the Code Page email branch</tool>
    <tool name="bash">npm build:prod</tool>
